      "description": "Watch Železničar Pančevo vs SC Braga highlights and goals from UEFA Europa Conference League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 23, 2026. A Tactical Battle in Pančevo On July 23, 2026, Železničar Pančevo hosted SC Braga in a high-stakes UEFA Europa Conference League clash. The atmosphere was thick with anticipation as both sides looked to establish their dominance early on, with the match developing into a grueling test of discipline and tactical patience. The Breakthrough Moment After a first half defined by midfield grit and early bookings—most notably for Janko Jevremovic in the 19th minute—the game opened up following the interval. SC Braga ramped up the pressure in the second half, leading to a pivotal breakthrough in the 67th minute when they were awarded a penalty. Ricardo Horta stepped up to the spot and calmly fired home, providing the clinical edge that had been missing throughout the earlier exchanges. Closing Out the Result The trailing hosts attempted to claw their way back, but the match became increasingly fractured by a flurry of late-game substitutions and yellow cards. Both sides saw players booked, including Zoran Popovic , Nemanja Vidojevic , Gabriel Silva , and Fran Navarro , as tempers rose during the closing stages. SC Braga stood firm under pressure, expertly managing the clock and the flow of play to ensure they walked away with the victory when the referee finally sounded the full-time whistle."
